OL,3,GNEWSATrump says he will remove all
OL,4,AIrish whiskey tariffs as he ends
OL,5,Atwo-day visit
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump announced he
OL,8,Fwill lift all tariffs on Irish whiskey
OL,9,Fat the end of his two-day visit to
OL,10,FIreland.
OL,12,FHe made the announcement before handing
OL,13,Fover the winner's trophy at the Trump
OL,14,FInternational golf resort in Doonbeg,
OL,15,FCo Clare, to Irish Open winner Shane
OL,16,FLowry.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
